```sql
-- Load httpfs extension for remote cloud object storage
INSTALL httpfs;
LOAD httpfs;

SET preserve_insertion_order = false;

-- Direct vectorized vectorization over remote cloud object storage
SELECT
    *
FROM read_parquet('https://storage.cloud.google.com/bucket_name/path/to/file.parquet')
JOIN my_table ON my_table.id = remote_parquet.id;
```

### Explanation:
`httpfs` provides a vectorized columnar engine over remote cloud object storage.
